          "settings": {
            "question": "Why This Product?",
            "answer": "<p>Our Vastu products are carefully designed based on authentic Vastu Shastra principles to help you create positive energy flow in your home or office space. Each product is thoughtfully crafted to address specific Vastu concerns and bring harmony, prosperity, and peace to your environment.</p>"
